    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "BWANA kutanya kufunga tumu kuseko kwa loli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja kana ja mori ghwa ikenda ghuwangwagha Kislevu, mwaka ghwa kana ghwa kubonya nguma kwa Mzuri Dario, BWANA oreghorieghe na ini Zekaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Betheli weredumieghe Shareza na Regem-meleki na wandu wawo Hekalunyi kwa BWANA Uwadie-Ndighi-Rose wilombe irasimio ja BWANA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kukotia wakohani na walodi ikoto iji: “Welee, dichurie kulila na kufunga tumu kwa wundu ghwa kunonwa kwa Hekalu mori ghwa kasanu, seji diduebonya kwa miaka mingi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukanizera huwu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Zera wakohani na waisanga wose kukaia, iji werekoghe wikifunga na kulila mori ghwa kasanu na ghwa mfungade kwa miaka iyo mirongo mfungade, ndewerebonyereghe huwo kwa ishima japo kungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na iji werejagha na kunywa, wadaaja kwa kukughudisha weni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha malagho nigho gheni BWANA oreghighoragha ukitumia walodi wa imbiri, ingelo Jerusalemu erekoghe nicha ichulo ni wandu; ngelo wandu werekoghe wengi wikikaia mizinyi na mbai mbai yaro, na masanga gha kusinyi, na wurindinyi cha magharibi kirimbenyi cha mighondi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kulegha kusikira niyo shekeria ya wandu kubarishwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukaghora na Zekaria ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kala nerewinekieghe wandu wapo sharia iri: ‘Mlindie kubonya hachi, mkaie na wughoma mmbeni na mmbeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msewikoronge waka wakiwa, wana wakiwa, waghenyi wiko aghadi konyu, angu mndungi usowagha. Msekaie na njama em'bonyera mndungi kiwiwi chingi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela wandu wapo wereleghieghe kusikira, wikaghilika, wikafindika madu ghawo wisesikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikakurisha ngolo rawo sa igho wisesikire sharia, na malagho ghapo agho nereghidumieghe kwa Roho wapo kwa chia ya walodi wa imbiri. Kwa huwo ngajokwa ni machu mabaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na angu wereleghieghe kusikira iji nereghorieghe nawo, nanimoni ngalegha kusikira iji werelombieghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngawifunya sa kudukwa ni kiremba ngawisaghisa aghadi ya mbari ra wandu wa masanga gha kighenyi. Iji isanga jiboie jikasighwa iduu jisena wandu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
